{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n3月11日です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"震災とは関係無いんですが\n人の死というものに最近、触れて\n改めて考えさせられます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショックとか\n悲しいとか\n辛いとか\nそんな言葉では表せない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年のこの日にはまだ無かった新しい感情に\n今年は気づきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被災された皆様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nそのご家族の皆様に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心よりお見舞い申し上げます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかだかな"}],"source":"archive"}